# into this file.
# Added here: Rhapsody's Kalimdor Kocktail (1452).
# Opens at Thelsamar, where the Riverglades guide's flight lands (Ghak's mushrooms for the Uldaman dig), then Hammertoe's
# Digsite and Garek. Scrounging (733) is handed to Sigrun on 30-40/06, so the digsite stop here is only for the optional
# Fiery Blaze Enchantments (fix round 1, 0.4.0: 40-50/01 no longer flies Ironforge -> Thelsamar -> back for Ghak).
# Safety Checks (97617), taken from Dorgaron on 30-40/06's Badlands loop: its Pristine Mattock lies at Agmond's End among
# the Stonevault Shamans (40-41) beside Murdaloc (42), taken here with him, and Dorgaron takes the quest on the ride north.

step Thelsamar
  zone Loch Modan
  tip Ghak Healtouch is below ground in Thelsamar, by the inn, where the flight lands. His mushrooms grow in the Uldaman dig at the Badlands' northern edge, on this guide's loop back north.
  accept 17                           -- Ghak Healtouch, below ground

step Badlands
  zone Badlands
  goto 53.8,43.3 "Hammertoe's Digsite"

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- The Badlands

step Hammertoe's Digsite
  zone Badlands
  tip Ride south out of Loch Modan through the pass into the Badlands; Sigrun Ironhew camps at the dig.
  accept 706 optional                 -- Fiery Blaze Enchantments: its Black Drake's Heart is a rare drop, so the work and hand-in are optional too

step Garek
  tip Garek camps by himself in Dustwind Gulch, south-east of the digsite.
  accept 732

step Agmond's End
  zone Badlands
  tip Dorgaron's Pristine Mattock lies in the middle of the Stonevault trogg camp, where Murdaloc walks.
  kill 2945 quest 739                 -- Murdaloc
  kill 2893 quest 739                 -- Stonevault Bonesnapper
  collect 278404 quest 97617 @49.3,68.3 map 1418 -- Pristine Mattock

step Valley of Fangs
  turnin 705                          -- Rigglefuzz: Blue Pearls from Stranglethorn
  note Rigglefuzz's next quest pays no experience: skip it.

step Boss Tho'grun
  tip Boss Tho'grun does not stay at Camp Boff: he walks a long loop around the Badlands with his guards, from the camp in the west along the south of the zone to about 61,69, north to about 49,49 and back west to the camp. The arrow follows his loop west from here until you meet him.
  loop
  goto 38.8,56.1
  goto 31.5,58.7
  goto 24.7,56.7
  goto 18.2,60.8
  goto 12.5,67.5
  goto 12.7,75.5
  goto 20.1,78.5
  goto 30.2,73.5
  goto 41.6,72.2
  goto 51.2,73.4
  goto 61.4,69.3
  goto 54.0,58.6
  goto 48.8,48.7
  collect 4640 quest 732              -- Sign of the Earth

step Garek
  tip Ride back east to Dustwind Gulch.
  turnin 732
  note Garek's next task is an elite hunt: skip it.

step Lethlor Ravine
  tip The Scalding Whelps nest in the ravine east of Garek; leave the Scorched Guardians (elite) alone. The Black Drake's Heart drops rarely: take it if it comes while you grind.
  collect 4612 quest 706 optional     -- Black Drake's Heart

step Hammertoe's Digsite
  turnin 706 optional                 -- Sigrun Ironhew

step Dorgaron
  zone Badlands
  tip Dorgaron camps at the foot of the pass into Loch Modan, on the way north.
  turnin 97617                        -- Dorgaron

