step The Uldaman dig
  zone Badlands
  tip Back through the pass: the Stonevault troggs dig outside Uldaman at the Badlands' northern edge. The carved urns and the magenta mushroom clusters sit in their caves and tunnels, outside the dungeon itself.
  collect 8047 quest 17               -- Magenta Fungus Cap; below ground
  collect 4610 quest 704              -- Carved Stone Urn; below ground

