# Mudsprocket: Drazzit Dripvalve's and Gizzix Grimegurgle's three Wyrmbog quests (98205, 98215, 98231, level 44,
# whelps and Firemane 41-44), after Theramore at about 45.4, then back to Theramore's flight master for Shen'dralas.
# They were on the Feralas guide behind `when zone "Dustwallow Marsh"`, which the route never met: it reaches Feralas
# from Shen'dralas (fix round 1, 0.4.0).

step Mudsprocket
  zone Dustwallow Marsh
  tip Take the road south-west out of Theramore to Mudsprocket, the goblin camp at the edge of the Wyrmbog. Drazzit and Gizzix stand together in the camp.
  accept 98205                        -- Drazzit Dripvalve
  accept 98215
  accept 98231                        -- Gizzix Grimegurgle

step The Wyrmbog
  zone Dustwallow Marsh
  tip The Wyrmtail grows in the bog east of the camp: gather it first. Then the Searing Hatchlings and Whelps (41-43) and the Firemane dragonkin nest in the bog north and west of Mudsprocket, on the way back; all of them drop the shed scales.
  tip Careful: the Firemane Scalebanes and Flamecallers are 43-44 and cast fire: pull them one at a time.
  collect 280092 quest 98231 @46.2,80.2 -- Wyrmtail
  kill 4323 quest 98205               -- Searing Hatchling
  kill 4324 quest 98205               -- Searing Whelp
  collect 279934 quest 98215          -- Shed Dark Dragonscale

step Mudsprocket
  zone Dustwallow Marsh
  tip Then ride back north-east to Theramore's flight master.
  turnin 98205                        -- Drazzit Dripvalve
  turnin 98215
  turnin 98231                        -- Gizzix Grimegurgle

